+# TLS certificate verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is enabled on all builds, development builds included, and this applies going forward. Local and development testing uses self-signed certificates rather than turning verification off. Traffic uses HTTPS everywhere with no plaintext exception, since the project now has proper certificate management.
